This patch logs all conducts for all deaths (and quits), not just 
ascentions.

It works by writing to a completely separate logfile (the normal logfile 
is still created as well).  To select the file (and enable the patch) 
#define <filename> in config.h.  The version of the patch that I have 
currently #defines the tournament log file to be: tournamentlogfile.

